o the \\\\\\\"Login\\\\\\\" page and enters their credentials.\\\\n    b. Upon successful authentication, the user is directed to the Resident Portal Dashboard.\\\\n    c. User clicks on the \\\\\\\"Secure Documents\\\\\\\" navigation link.\\\\n    d. User browses the categorized list of documents and clicks to view or download a specific file.\\\\n\\\\n**3. Administrator Posts a New Update:**\\\\n    a. Administrator logs in with their admin credentials.\\\\n    b. Administrator navigates to the admin panel and selects \\\\\\\"News & Announcements\\\\\\\".\\\\n    c. Administrator clicks \\\\\\\"Create New Post,\\\\\\\" fills out a title and content using a rich-text editor, and clicks \\\\\\\"Publish.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    d. The new post immediately appears on the public-facing \\\\\\\"News & Announcements\\\\\\\" page.\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderID\\\": \\\"ORDER-VORNE-20240521-01\\\"\\n}\\n###<VORNE-REPORT-20240521-03>###\\n###<VORNE-CLARIFY-20240521-04>###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nFrom: Chief Delta\\nTo: System\\nType: CLARIFY\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"To proceed with creating a detailed Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP), we must resolve several key ambiguities in the project requirements. Answering these questions now will prevent costly rework, ensure the final product meets the user's needs, and define the scope of work regarding third-party services, data migration, and design.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"How should the identity of a new user be verified to ensure they are a legitimate resident before their account is approved?\\\",\\n    \\\"How will HOA dues be collected? Do you have a preferred payment processor?\\\",\\n    \\\"Do you already have a domain name (e.g., 'myhoa.com') and a web hosting provider?\\\",\\n    \\\"Should a directory of residents be available to other logged-in residents?\\\",\\n    \\\"Are there any existing brand guidelines, logos, or color schemes we must use for the website's design?\\\",\\n    \\\"Is there any exi